6	  Poppins fonts and icons.js. Write one <template data-step> per step inside <body>, in order.
7	  Leave the "DO NOT EDIT" blocks alone: they mirror the app's tokens and keyframes
8	  (references/pattern.md, sections 3 and 4).
9	
10	  Icons: an empty `i` element with data-icon="paper" and class="ic ic-sm". The name is a file
11	  in the skill's assets/icons without the .svg; the step mounts it as the design system's SVG.
12	
13	  Contract with the studio (render.mjs, stills.mjs and tour.mjs record): window.DURATION,
14	  window.READY and window.seek(t). Preview in a browser with index.html?play, or one step with
15	  index.html?play&step=2.
16	-->
